  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2024-09-25T13:33:50-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, September 25, 2024, 1:33 pm\">September 25, 2024</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild is returning to Jake Rooney’s in Harwich Port (<a href=\"https://www.jakerooneys.com\">https://www.jakerooneys.com</a>) for our Annual Dinner on October 25th.   Contact Cindy Manteiga for more information  and reservation.  (Cindy’s email:  <a href=\"mailto:cmanteiga@comcast.net\"><strong>cmanteiga@comcast.net</strong></a>) Members can bring one guest. Come join us for a fun price fixed evening.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
